    "section": "Dominatus Event Companion",
    "summary": "If you chose Tactical Missions, shuffle the Secondary Mission deck and leave it face down. As your Command phase begins, turn up two cards from that deck to become your active missions. Once in the battle, as your Command phase ends, you may pay 1 CP to replace an active Secondary Mission card with one newly drawn card.",
